        "original_id": "42abeda6-34f3-52c9-b71d-bd1b037da512",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kristin Davis, Darren Star, Brooke Shields\n- Products: Melrose Place, Sex and the City, Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids, Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends, Harvest Time Hop and Fly\n- Companies: HBO\n- Topics: acting roles, television series, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- Kristin Davis, also listed as Kristin Lee Davis, was born on February 23, 1965, and is an American actress.\n- Sex and the City was an American romantic comedy television series created by Darren Star and produced by HBO.\n- Sex and the City aired from 1998 to 2004 and had 94 episodes in its original run.\n- Kristin Davis played Brooke Armstrong on the soap opera Melrose Place from 1995 to 1996.\n- Kristin Davis played Charlotte York Goldenblatt on HBO's Sex and the City from 1998 to 2004.\n- Miss Spider first appeared in cartoon format in the movie Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids, with Brooke Shields providing the voice of Miss Spider.\n- Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids spun off the series Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends, in which Kristin Davis provided the voice of Miss Spider.\n- Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids also spun off the video game Harvest Time Hop and Fly.",
